        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Ground: cotton and linen.  Lower half: scrolling bands filled with flowers enclosing flowering fruit branches and exotic birds on trees which flank a central cartouche containing a basket of flowers; upper half: garlands of fruit and flowers framing formal motifs worked in polychrome wools in chain stitch with some details in French knots.  Some mends and holes, some yarns rotted out."@en ;
